      "cooked": "<p>Greetings, fellow Multiverse savers!</p><p>I was doing a bit of research regarding our beloved heroes and the comics from which they come. Pouring over the flavor text of the hero text, I got multiple titles in the Sentinel Comics line, and think I put together some of their themes/storylines.</p><table><tbody>\n<tr><td>A Day in the Life - one-shots showcasing what our heroes average day looks like.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Absolution - Fanatic's origin</td></tr>\n<tr><td>America's Finest Legacy - Legacy's line</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Arcane Tales - fairly long Ra storyline (98 issues)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Baptism by Fire - Fanatic and Ra crossover</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Battle Unending - Haka storyline</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Burying the Blade - Side story where Baron Blade may be dead. (Lots of Blade Battalions. No Blade himself)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Cosmic Challenge - ??</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Cosmic Concurrence - probably will know more with next expansion</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Double-Tap - An Expatriette line</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Draw! - Chrono-Ranger one-shot</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Emigrant's Song - Expatriette either entering or leaving Insula Primalis</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Engine Block Blues - Mr. Fixer story</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Exordium - ??</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Fabric of Depair - a Gloomweaver event?</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Fanatic - Fanatic's main line</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Freedom Five - At least 932 issues!! One of the main lines of Sentinel Comics</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Freedom Five, Annual - 30 years of mega cross-overs, needing larger teams of heroes</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Hero of the Arena - Parse??</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Into the Sunset - Story involving the Citizens of the Sun&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Justice Comics - One of the main lines of Sentinel Comics, primarily featuring Legacy</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Legacy Independence Day Spectacular</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Lightspeed - Tachyon line</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Mind over Matter - Visionary's main line?</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Moonfall - Baron Blade tries to bring down the moon</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Mother Earth One-shot - Probably a pre-issue for the Akash'buta event</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Mystery Comics - One of the main lines of Sentinel Comics, primarily featuring the Wraith</td></tr>\n<tr><td>New Memories - The Visionary's origin</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Nightmare World - The Dreamer cross-over event</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Nightmist - Nightmist's main line</td></tr>\n<tr><td>One Man Army - A Bunker series</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Out of Time - Short series featuring KNYFE</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Prime Wardens - Adventures of this group</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Ra: God of the Sun - Ra's main line</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Rebirth of Ra One-shot - Ra's origin story</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Rook City Renegades - The Chairmen cross-over event</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Run of Luck - Setback's line?</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Science &amp; Progress One-shot - one shot of our science heroes</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Singularity - Omnitron-X storyline, including a possible sacrifice (issue 8)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Southwest Sentinels - The Sentinels main line</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Stranger in a Strange World - Tempest's come to Earth story</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Sunrise - Citizen Dawn cross-ver event</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Temporal Targets - Chrono-Ranger's line</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Terminal Ballistics - Expatriette's line</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Terminus - ??</td></tr>\n<tr><td>The Curse - Nightmist's origin story, trained by someone called \"The Master\"</td></tr>\n<tr><td>The Deadliest Game - Ambuscade targeting different heroes</td></tr>\n<tr><td>The Final Legacy - Iron Legacy cross-over event</td></tr>\n<tr><td>The Ice-Man Cometh - Absolute Zero's solo line?</td></tr>\n<tr><td>The Indestructible Bunker - Bunker's main line</td></tr>\n<tr><td>The Last Hunt - Chrono-Ranger hunts Plague Rat, who somehow makes it back to Rook City</td></tr>\n<tr><td>The Savage Haka - Haka's main line</td></tr>\n<tr><td>The Sentinels - probably a line for the Sentinels team, but main line seems to be Southwest Sentinels</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Tides of Time - La Capitan's battle</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Time and Again - Omnitron-X's line</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Time Cataclysm - one-shot w/ Chrono-Ranger</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Toll of Destiny - Argent Adept's origin story</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Tomb of the Bizarre - Seems to be everywhere, but includes Naturalist's origin story (24-26)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Transmission of Honor - A Mr. Fixer storyline</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Vagabond's Tale - Scholar's origin story</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Vengeance - A six issue storyline detailed Baron Blade's Vengence (latest expansion)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Virtuoso of the Void - Argent Adept's main line</td></tr>\n</tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I've just poured through the hero decks as of right now. I plan on going through the villian decks as well. What do you all think? Am I missing anything?</p>",
